1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,000
[App Launch] The app opens, displaying a system compatibility check for 16 KB page sizes before proceeding.

2
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:19,500
[Home Dashboard] The main dashboard loads, displaying live weather telemetry, Bio-Markers, and daily wellness rituals.

3
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:27,500
[User Action] The user grants Health & Wellness permissions, allowing the app to sync sleep and biological vitals.

4
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:50,000
[Screen Transition] The user reviews their biological progress before navigating to the Unified Collection Hub.

5
00:00:50,500 --> 00:01:11,500
[Act I: The Footprint] The user opens the Vanity archive and begins importing 173 cosmetic items from the database.

6
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:46,500
[Data Processing] The Glow Archive populates. The user explores their Chromatic DNA, viewing the dynamic color spectrum and skincare categories.

7
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:52,500
[UI Detail] Inspecting a specific lipstick, the user views value analysis, clinical safety, and detailed ingredient profiles.

8
00:01:53,000 --> 00:02:19,500
[Screen Update] The Vanity portfolio performance is calculated, displaying a total investment value of $4,562 for the imported cosmetics.

9
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:37,500
[User Action] Transitioning to the Wardrobe, the user explores the Fashion Vault and imports 54 curated apparel items.

10
00:02:38,000 --> 00:03:20,000
[Data Processing] The deterministic engine calculates Wardrobe DNA, generating an interactive color spectrum and a $6,210 portfolio value.

11
00:03:20,500 --> 00:03:51,000
[Unified Portfolio] Returning to the dashboard, the total combined closet investment updates to $10,772. The user browses the KoColor Store.

12
00:03:51,500 --> 00:04:11,500
[Act III: The Synthesis] The user launches the AI Fashion Advisor and uploads a photo to define their visual ID.

13
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:23,500
[Machine Learning] The on-device face detection analyzes the user's aesthetic DNA, mapping them to a Neutral Summer seasonal palette.

14
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:51,500
[UI Interaction] The user sets their anchor constraints, manually selecting specific colors for their clothing and makeup items.

15
00:04:52,000 --> 00:05:07,500
[Settings] The user navigates to Settings to review the AI Configuration, preparing to test different execution modes.

16
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:19,500
[System Action] The user executes the Style Advisor using the Offline Algorithm Mode (No AI), triggering the deterministic engine.

17
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:36,500
[UI Detail] The resulting Style Blueprint is generated by the Local Architect, displaying a baseline FASHIONISTA score of 81.

18
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:47,500
[User Action] The user saves this locally-generated outfit to their Color Analysis History log.

19
00:05:48,000 --> 00:06:26,500
[Settings] The user returns to settings, enables "Bring Your Own Key" (BYOK), and configures a custom Gemini API key for cloud execution.

20
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:50,500
[System Action] The user runs the Style Advisor again, this time utilizing BYOK Cloud Execution and the active Gemini LLM.

21
00:06:51,000 --> 00:07:13,500
[UI Detail] A new, AI-optimized blueprint is generated. The user reviews the recommendations and saves them to the personal collection.

22
00:07:14,000 --> 00:07:24,500
[Settings] The user navigates back to Settings and disables the BYOK configuration to test the next tier of AI execution.

23
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:40,500
[System Action] The Style Advisor is run using the Secure Cloud (Firebase Vault Encrypted) execution pipeline.

24
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:58,500
[UI Detail] The system returns a highly optimized Style Blueprint, achieving a FASHIONISTA score of 85 out of 100.

25
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:21,500
[Screen Transition] The user opens the "Style Journey," reading a curated, step-by-step editorial rationale of the AI's decision process.

26
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:44,500
[Settings] For the final test, the user navigates to settings and enables Enterprise Security via Firebase AI.

27
00:08:45,000 --> 00:09:13,500
[System Action] The final outfit generation occurs through the Firebase AI pipeline, rendering a blueprint with an 80 FASHIONISTA score.

28
00:09:14,000 --> 00:09:32,000
[Closing] The user returns to the Home Dashboard, reviews the Atelier Boutique, and concludes the session.